From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 14:35:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] The day's contact question waits when the owner came with a
 question
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The tester's 58416 (a real owner, 14 Oct): her question on a political
topic was answered, and „სხვათა შორის, <contact> სად მუშაობს? თუ არ
იცი, არა უშავს." was tacked onto the answer. (Read-only check: the
contact is in her own book, from the old phonebook sync, under the name
she saved; nothing of anybody else's was shown.)

An owner who came with a question of their own now gets the answer and
nothing else: a line with a question mark, or one that opens with a
question word (ka, en, ru, es), keeps the day's question back for a
moment of small talk. Same place as the other skips (goals, deaths,
„what waits", questions about the owner). No new text.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
